        "Content": "•\tCombi gas boiler.(3 years old)\r\n•\tTriple glazing & composite doors (5 years old)\r\n•\tNo onward chain.\r\n•\tFully rewired.\r\n•\tLow maintenance rear garden.\r\n•\tRear vehicular access.\r\n•\tLarge garage.\r\n•\tNew resin drive way to front.\r\n•\tNew resin patio to rear.\r\n•\tInteriorlly Insulated\r\n•\tAttic floored with ample storage space.\r\n•\tContact BROE auctionneers to register your interest."
